        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "This piece is of a very quaint character and suggests more the technique of metal than thread lace. Belongs to a very remarkable variety of which many large specimens have been found. Made for many centuries and is still done at the present day. Narrowing edging made of groups of loops."@en ;
